@host = http://localhost:5107
@key = dev-ingest-key

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Ingest a large deposit; repeat to verify duplicate handling
POST {{host}}/api/events/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

{"eventId":"example-1","memberId":"member-01","type":"Deposit","amount":60000,"currency":"USD","occurredAt":"2026-11-12T02:00:00Z"}

### Batch
POST {{host}}/api/events/transactions/batch
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

[{"eventId":"example-2","memberId":"member-02","type":"Deposit","amount":11000,"currency":"USDT","occurredAt":"2026-11-12T02:01:00Z"}]

### Search
GET {{host}}/api/alerts?currency=USD&page=1&pageSize=50

### Copy an alert ID from search
@alertId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}

### Acknowledge
POST {{host}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{"by":"demo-operator"}

### Resolve
POST {{host}}/api/alerts/{{alertId}}/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{"by":"demo-operator"}

### Rule configuration
GET {{host}}/api/rules

### Disable one rule
PUT {{host}}/api/rules/LARGE_TXN
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false,"parameters":{}}

### Notification settings
GET {{host}}/api/notification-settings

### Disable USD notifications
PUT {{host}}/api/notification-settings/USD
Content-Type: application/json

{"enabled":false,"minSeverity":"High","chatIdOverride":null}

### Outbound records
GET {{host}}/api/notifications?alertId={{alertId}}

### Summary
GET {{host}}/api/stats/summary?hours=24

### Shared catalog
GET {{host}}/api/i18n/zh-TW
